    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey my 4 yr old has a fever of 101 and these tiny red/purple spots all over his stomach and legs. i tried pressing a glass against them but the spots don't go away when i press down. is this just like a heat rash or something from a virus? i dont want to take him to the er if it isnt serious",
